{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"870962448058966046","content":"<@&851451106226601995> we'll be using this channel to divide up the loot from Tonight's event. If you're here you participated in the event to some degree so you get a say in loot. This is all out of character and if you're dead you'll still get your gear. Once the list of group loot is posted, you will have until noon server time on sunday (36 hours from midnight) to determine who gets what. Hopefully this won't have to be moderated and y'all are responsible adults, but i want to be clear: **SAYING YOU WANT SOMETHING FIRST DOES *NOT* ENTITLE YOU TO IT.** Each player has the time to weigh in and you all can discuss division. If multiple people want the same thing that's up to you all to decide. Loot list to be posted shortly, love y'all.","created_at":"2021-07-31T09:39:24.002000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870963851829583912","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"870962448058966046","content":"**Modified Essence Roll Table**\nFor the essence you receive as loot, roll a d6 instead of a d20 to determine its primary quality (a secondary quality may be any of the 20 types) and a d100 to determine rarity.\n1 - chaotic\n2 - dimensional\n3 - inert\n4 - lightning\n5 - mercurial\n6 - phantasmal","created_at":"2021-07-31T10:09:41.810000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"870971476268970054","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
